<title>GERMANY: German 1996 coffee imports higher at 11.98 mln T.</title>
<headline>German 1996 coffee imports higher at 11.98 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>German net green coffee imports from outside the European Union totalled 11.98 million bags in the 1996 calendar year compared with 11.65 million the year before, the DKV coffee association said.</p>
<p>Imports of 1.03 million bags in December were below those in November at 1.06 million and slightly above 1.02 million recorded in December 1995.</p>
<p>Brazil shipped 224,217 bags in December after 188,602 in November, Colombia 203,847 (160,187), Kenya 90,123 (66,470), Papua New Guinea 70,572 (83,096) and El Salvador 57,519 (63,557).</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
